WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.100
I heard from Claus-san.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.360
You're planning to extract the
 Demon Lord's power from Mio?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.110
He also told me that might cause Mio harm.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.230
She's just a normal girl, you know.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.330
Yet you...

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.380
What do you think about Mio?

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.120
What...

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.290
What do you think she is?!

