00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.430
What nonsense.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.790
It doesn't matter what happens to her in service to the people.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.590
That's her fate for being born the ruler's daughter.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.230
From what I hear,

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:17.240
you've forged a Master-Servant pact with her?

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.810
I see.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:24.370
A foolish girl who drowns herself in pleasure is unfit to reign.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.620
What did you say?!

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:30.760
Please stand down.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.760
Okay, okay! That's enough!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.760
<i>Mother?</i>

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:43.260
No one's going to benefit from from an outbreak of violence.{you three arguing.}

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:48.020
Basara-kun, if anything happens to you here,

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.770
Mio-chan and the others will be pained, right?

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.150
So, we'll be going now.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.910
I'm sure you're still too worked up
 to get any sleep, aren't you, Basara-kun?

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.690
I need to help you calm down.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.900
So, that's why we came here, huh?

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.890
Pardon me, Basara-sama.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:21.800
Huh?

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.800
Z-Zest?!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.750
Y-You're...

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.620
<i>I think they've{she's} gotten bigger since last time...</i>

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.480
<i>Wait, what am I thinking?!</i>

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.340
Pardon me.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.860
H-Hold on!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.530
Please pay me no mind.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:44.660
I learned from Shella-sama that this is
 how one should wash her master's back.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:54.860
It's proper etiquette for a maid. Proper etiquette.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.420
Basara-kun...

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:07.260
Would you mind forming a
 Master-Servant pact with Zest-chan?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.170
Huh?

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:09.210
Shella-sama?

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:12.880
If the confrontation with the reigning Demon Lord faction escalates,

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.750
Zest-chan's position will grow even more precarious.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.650
Too precarious for me to cover for.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.030
Only if that's what Zest wants.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.870
But, if I...

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.410
Mio and the others will welcome you also.{I already have consent from Mio and the others.}

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.350
Then—

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.880
So, Zest,

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.420
if you don't mind,

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.180
would you let me protect you?

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:44.850
No.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.320
I see—

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.750
I don't want to just be protected.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.500
I want to protect you, too, Basara-sama.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.560
Zest...

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.190
Please make me your maid, Basara-sama.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:04:59.630
Sure.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:11.680
So, now Zest-chan is Basara-kun's Servant as well.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:21.380
Huh? Why?!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.620
I thought the pact went well{?}!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.180
My, my...

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.750
It seems that somewhere in her heart,

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:32.510
Zest-chan thought she might be a burden to you if she became your Servant.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:33.950
"A burden"?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.460
I-I'm sorry, Basara-sama.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.070
Zest...

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:51.010
Accept me as your Master.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.270
B-Basara-sama.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.750
I understand.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.250
Basara-sama...

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:25.820
Zest...

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.980
N-No...

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.290
<i>{Wh-}Why?</i>

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:46.300
<i>Why can't I stop this h-heat?</i>

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:57.000
Now Zest-chan, please bring basara-kun more blessings,

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.000
for the sake of being his true maid.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.600
Got it.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.000
Basara-sama...

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.500
Basara-sama...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.000
I am....

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.400
for Basara-sama...

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:24.600
Yeah.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:25.400
I got it.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.700
Seems like that's where you want it.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.000
No...

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.350
Zest, i'll relieve you in a moment.

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.410
Zest-chan,

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:09.600
are you still anxious about serving at Basara-kun's side?

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.710
No.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:14.820
Basara-sama has chosen me to be his maid.{I'm already his maid, after all.}

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.000
<i>Wilbert.</i>

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.740
My father.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.760
Yesterday's...

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.080
Mio-sama...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.720
It's morning already?

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.380
Huh?!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.020
Huh?

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:30.290
What? What? What?

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:47.430
In the name of Lord Leohart, I offer you this warning!

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:53.180
We already know that the former
 Demon Lord's daughter is in this city.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:58.570
That daughter will become a seed for new strife in the demon realm.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.820
What shall we do?

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.960
Hand her over at once!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.300
Or else...

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:21.100
You're going easy.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.120
If you'd kill all the residents to make a statement,

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.690
this would end much sooner.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.840
Keep your opinions to yourself.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:33.250
Nebra, you're only an observer in this operation.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:38.540
Of course, Gald-dono, but the elders on the council

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:42.360
are looking forward to the actions you take as a high-ranking war hero.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:44.780
Go.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.530
What on earth is that giant?!

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:02.190
I'm going to see my sister!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.880
We can't just stay quiet and watch, either.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.060
Can you carry me?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.240
Perfectly fine.

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:12.390
M-Me, too!

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:14.390
N-No, Mio-sama!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:17.690
What would we do if anything were to happen to you{, Mio-sama}?!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.650
Now isn't the time for that talk!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.880
Perfect timing.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.650
Make sure Mio-sama doesn't take a step from that room.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.120
But I—!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.820
You cannot fall into your enemy's trap.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:34.160
This is a complicated political issue.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.660
Stay here, Mio.

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.210
Yuki?!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.530
I'm sure Basara would tell you the same thing.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:44.410
Kurumi.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.670
Right, leave it to me.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.430
Fire!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.350
Fools.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.730
Run!

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.050
Zest?

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.540
I'm fighting someone as low as you?

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.260
Interesting!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:35.400
So you're that man's son!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.520
I won't let you go...

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.560
any farther!

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.750
<i>I can't believe I'm able
 to fight for Basara-sama.</i>

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.380
Crush it!

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:11.970
I won't let you pass!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:26.020
Dance, fire spirits of the demon realm!

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:31.900
You're persistent!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:34.790
Kurumi-san, please leave this to me!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.680
Rukia-neesama!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.710
You mustn't let down your guard, Maria.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.770
Good luck, everyone!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.300
There! Right there!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:59.080
Right there! There!

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.360
Get him!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.830
Is that all you've got, son of the war god?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.720
Aren't you a bit too fragile?

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:22.410
<i>H-He's strong.</i>

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:26.080
<i>But I can't afford to back down here.</i>

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.920
Playtime's almost over.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.030
Go.

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.310
Basara!

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.450
Basara-san?!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.960
M-Mio-sama!

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.670
<i>Basara! Basara! Basara! Basara!</i>

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.710
<i>Basara!</i>

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:20.670
Mio.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.040
You'll catch a cold before we
 even get to the demon realm.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:31.320
What do you think will happen to me when I go to the demon realm?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.230
Mio?

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.340
Sorry.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.020
I know this isn't very like me.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:37.980
Forget about it.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.760
Mio!

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:43.670
Basara?

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:50.900
Don't worry.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.090
Wherever we go,

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:56.380
I'll always fight alongside you,

00:15:58.510 --> 00:15:59.630
no matter what happens.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:02.380
Yeah.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:19.360
Pass in peace, child of the war god.

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:27.150
How on earth did—?!

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.410
So that's how it is.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.180
What?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:19.980
Basara?

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.700
No way.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:37.590
Hmm,

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.820
I might have overdone it a bit.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:46.070
But that's how a trump card ought to be used.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.420
Nebra! You bastard!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.620
Don't think poorly of me, Gald-dono.

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:57.000
If Leohart gains any more power,

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.000
matters will become more difficult to manage.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:03.090
So, I'll ask to you leave the stage.

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:05.340
Nebra!

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.390
Now then...

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:15.230
I guess we ought to put on the final touches.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:34.650
My, my, I didn't expect you to come out on your own.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.000
I won't forgive you.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.250
How dare you...

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.770
How dare you do that to Basara!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:44.660
The power you inherited is troublesome to handle.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:49.010
I do feel sorry for you,
 but you'll have to take an early leave.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:51.230
I'll never...

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:51.890
forgive you!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.660
Huh?!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:18.040
I'll kill you a million times over!

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:37.870
Mio!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.350
A-A high-ranking heroic spirit fell?!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.900
What power!

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:53.280
It appears Belphegor-sama's fears were valid!

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:03.290
Damned ghost of Wilbert!

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.980
I'll eliminate the entire city!

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.920
Wh-What?!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:14.920
Gravity magic?

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:15.810
No way!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.000
Ramsus-sama!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.660
That's impossible!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.210
<i>Wh-What do I do?</i>

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.610
<i>I-If I return after this...</i>

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.110
<i>I'll...</i>

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.140
Die!

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:59.680
You!

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.790
Don't lay your hands...

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.440
on my sister!

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:05.710
Basara-san!

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:06.770
Basara-sama!

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:20.010
Sp-Spare me!

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.830
Why you! How dare you...!

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:23.880
How dare you attack Mio!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:26.260
F-Forgive me!

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.840
I-I was just following orders!

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.710
Whose orders?!

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.840
Tell me!

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.900
I-It was—!

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:51.320
So that's...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:55.080
the Master-Servant pact's...

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:58.900
Basara...

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:50.060
I'll be taking this one back.

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:53.400
Leohart has very few allies he can trust.

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:54.440
Lars!

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:57.320
I thought you belonged to the moderate faction.

00:23:57.320 --> 00:24:00.170
I have my own complicated circumstances.

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:02.010
How many do you think died?!

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:05.830
Let's settle everything, shall we?

00:24:06.280 --> 00:24:07.540
Settle it?

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:10.580
Gather all the actors and come to our castle.

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:15.210
The reigning Demon Lord,

00:24:15.600 --> 00:24:18.970
Leohart, is awaiting your arrival.

00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:22.890
Lars...
